<title>JAPAN: Current stock prices to hurt bank earnings--BOJ.</title>
<headline>Current stock prices to hurt bank earnings--BOJ.</headline>
<dateline>OSAKA, Japan 1997-01-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japanese banks' earnings results will be greatly affected by the current level of Tokyo stock prices, a senior Bank of Japan (BOJ) official said on Friday.</p>
</text>
